                            <td class="vibe-py-3 vibe-px-4"><TypeBadge Type="string" /></td>
                            <td class="vibe-py-3 vibe-px-4 vibe-text-zinc-500">null</td>
                            <td class="vibe-py-3 vibe-px-4 vibe-text-zinc-600 dark:vibe-text-zinc-400">ID of the currently active tab</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="vibe-py-3 vibe-px-4 vibe-font-mono vibe-text-sm vibe-text-zinc-900 dark:vibe-text-zinc-100">ActiveTabIdChanged</td>
                            <td class="vibe-py-3 vibe-px-4"><TypeBadge Type="EventCallback&lt;string&gt;" /></td>
                            <td class="vibe-py-3 vibe-px-4 vibe-text-zinc-500">—</td>
                            <td class="vibe-py-3 vibe-px-4 vibe-text-zinc-600 dark:vibe-text-zinc-400">Callback when active tab changes (enables two-way binding)</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
